+/* --- minimal binary registry hive (regf) reader for RegLoadAppKey ----------
  *
+ * Wine's registry server only understands its own text format, so it cannot
+ * load Windows binary "regf" hives. RegLoadAppKey is used (e.g. by Autodesk's
